{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831100/extras/Objectives.png?t=1768902955\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break into toy stores. Steal toys. Avoid the terrors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a toy collector who takes the hobby a bit too far... by breaking into toy stores at night. Whether alone or with a crew of up to 3 other goofy robbers, you\u2019ll sneak into stores, loot them clean, and escape before employees return in the morning.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it won\u2019t be easy. The stores are heavily guarded by deadly, AI-controlled security toys programmed to protect the stores at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831100/extras/034c40efeb95fe04b1a8b160578b9ae9.poster.avif?t=1768902955\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831100/extras/034c40efeb95fe04b1a8b160578b9ae9.webm?t=1768902955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831100/extras/034c40efeb95fe04b1a8b160578b9ae9.mp4?t=1768902955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831100/extras/ToyCollections.png?t=1768902955\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you collect them all?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot toys ranging from common plushies to ultra-rare collectibles. Every item you steal is added to your personal display in your warehouse.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell duplicate toys for cash to unlock new gear, cosmetics, and tools to help with future robberies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831100/extras/1416a3aa6d775c3a34bb75e12df29243.poster.avif?t=1768902955\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831100/extras/1416a3aa6d775c3a34bb75e12df29243.webm?t=1768902955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831100/extras/1416a3aa6d775c3a34bb75e12df29243.mp4?t=1768902955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831100/extras/DeadlySecurities.png?t=1768902955\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The only problem? The toy stores are guarded by deadly, AI-powered security produced by StoreGuard Systems.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Go prepared, these things don\u2019t play around. Bring traps, weapons and scanners to survive the night and escape with the loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831100/extras/96db88eec69691e93cb517256d06d376.poster.avif?t=1768902955\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831100/extras/96db88eec69691e93cb517256d06d376.webm?t=1768902955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831100/extras/96db88eec69691e93cb517256d06d376.mp4?t=1768902955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/s